  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - As a result of the excessive scale of the rear extension and projection beyond the rear elevation of the adjoining property, the development would be a bulky and disproportionate extension that harms the appearance of the house and the living conditions of the adjoining neighbour due to an increased sense of enclosure and undue loss of outlook and to the unattached neighbour to a lesser degree. The proposal therefore fails to comply with adopted Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the Residential Extension Guidelines.\r\n"
